==Notes==
* Slings can be used with a [[shield]].
* Like [[bow]]s, the sling is automatically [[mighty]] +0, granting no bonus damage for high [[strength]] (in the absence of an explicit ''mighty'' property), but enforcing a damage penalty for low strength.
* A sling is considered a [[throwing weapon]] for the [[good aim]] feat.

==Toolset==
* Slings are listed in the [[sling blueprint category]] on the [[item palette]] in the [[Toolset]].
